You eat, you drink and then you leave.

1202
01:39:34.501 --> 01:39:39.126
A life is a good life only if...

1203
01:39:39.542 --> 01:39:43.626
A life is a good life only if...

1204
01:39:43.626 --> 01:39:48.501
Without a wince, you ate,
you drank, you left.

1205
